{"t":"Goblin Merchant Quest","s":"goblin-merchant-quest-90c3f","k":"quest","i":"assets/wiki/Goblin_Merchant_Quest_Trunk_945fea.png","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Goblin Merchant Quest</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"aka\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Aliases</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">None.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"log\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Quest Log</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Goblin Merchant Quest</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Requirements</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"premium\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Premium</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"lvl\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">0<br/>(35 recommended)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">9.80<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">December 12, 2012<br/>Winter Update 2012</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Quests</nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-quest-legend\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Legend\">Legend</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Rafzan\">Rafzan</a> can always use an extra hand to help out.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Venore\">Venore</a>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-dangers\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dangers\">Dangers</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Snake\">Snakes</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Marsh%20Stalker\">Marsh Stalkers</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Swampling\">Swamplings</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Corym\">Coryms</a>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-reward\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Reward\">Reward</span></h3>\n<p>5200 exp, 1100 gp, achievement <a href=\"#/wiki/Task%20Manager\">Task Manager</a>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-spoiler\">\n<div class=\"tw-cmd showhide-visible showhide-init quest-spoiler\" data-command=\"showhide-content\" data-showhide-value=\"visible\">\n<div class=\"showhide-header\" data-showhide-element=\"header\">Click to show/hide the quest spoiler.<br/><span style=\"font-size: 0.8em;\">(settings)</span></div>\n<div class=\"showhide-body\" data-showhide-element=\"body\">\n<div class=\"spoiler-pretext\">Spoiler • edit</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Required\">Required</span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Rope\">Rope</a>, or equivalent</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Shovel\">Shovel</a>, or equivalent</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Mouldy%20Cheese\">Mouldy Cheese</a></li></ul>\n<p>The following items you will be given by NPC <a href=\"#/wiki/Rafzan\">Rafzan</a>. If you lose them before completing the task you will need to purchase more from him.\n</p>\n<ul><li>3 <a href=\"#/wiki/Advertisement%20Sign\">Advertisement Signs</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Perfume%20Gatherer%20%28First%29\">Perfume Gatherer</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Guardcatcher\">Guardcatcher</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Bottle%20with%20Rat%20Urine\">Bottle with Rat Urine</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Trunkhammer\">Trunkhammer</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Tips\">Tips</span></h2>\n<p>Here are some tips for frequent taskers, to be more efficient in completing these tasks.\n</p>\n<ul><li>Unless you need the money, you can purchase <a href=\"#/wiki/Perfume%20Gatherer%20%28First%29\">Perfume Gatherers</a> from <a href=\"#/wiki/Rafzan\">Rafzan</a>. The slug cave has 27-28 <a href=\"#/wiki/Slug\">Slugs</a> in it at full spawn; you can do a full circuit to supply yourself for the whole month, or however many you choose. This will save a lot of time. Note that you only need to purchase for the initial supply, as you will receive another empty one each time you accept the task.</li>\n<li>The tasks Destroy and Busy both take you to the <a href=\"#/wiki/Venore%20Corym%20Cave\">Venore Corym Cave</a>. Save time by doing both tasks at once.</li>\n<li>The tasks Guards, Kill, Advertising can be done together as the quest targets are all over the surface of the swamp. However, it's a bad idea to roam the swamp randomly. The <a href=\"#/quest/venore-daily-tasks-quest\">Venore Daily Tasks Quest</a> are additional tasks designed for lower levels. The reward isn't that great by itself, but the most important thing is that they provide direction. You will be going all over the swamp anyway, you might as well do the additional tasks. On doing the 3 Venore daily tasks, you should have no problems finding enough objectives for these tasks.</li>\n<li>Consider digging for a <a href=\"#/wiki/Leech\">Leech</a> if you go to the northern construction site. You can do this once per week.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Method\">Method</span></h2>\n<p>Leave <a href=\"#/wiki/Venore\">Venore</a> from the eastern exit (go down <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33004,32095,6\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33004, 32095, 6)</a>). Leave the building and go east a few steps to find a ladder and/or ramp. This is the central construction site (<a href=\"#/quest/venore-daily-tasks-quest\">Venore Daily Tasks Quest</a>). Go to the north-eastern platform and down the ladder. Go east to find a fancy building. On the south side of the building there is an elevator (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33051,32099,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33051, 32099, 7)</a>). Use the <a href=\"#/wiki/Pulley\">Pulley</a> if the elevator is up, to bring it down. Now step on the elevator and use the pulley to go up.\n</p><p>Ask <a href=\"#/wiki/Rafzan\">Rafzan</a> if he needs <b>help</b>. He will offer you 6 <b>tasks</b>. In order to receive the tasks you must say <b>get</b> and then the task name. In order to report, say <b>report</b> and then the task name. For future references, you don't need to say \"help\", \"tasks\", \"get\" or \"report\", just the mission's keyword.\n</p><p>The following tasks are available:\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>Reward\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Advertisement\n</td>\n<td>600 exp, 100 gp\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Perfume\n</td>\n<td>1000 exp, 200 gp\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Guards\n</td>\n<td>600 exp, 100 gp\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Busy\n</td>\n<td>1200 exp, 300 gp\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Destroy\n</td>\n<td>1200 exp, 300 gp\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Kill\n</td>\n<td>600 exp, 100 gp\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Total\n</th>\n<th>5200 exp, 1100 gp\n</th></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>You can repeat tasks every 20 hours. After 500 tasks you will receive the <a href=\"#/wiki/Task%20Manager\">Task Manager</a> achievement. You can do all six of the tasks of the Goblin Merchant Quest at the same time. It is highly recommended to accept all tasks you will do, to save time.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Business_Opportunities\"><span id=\"w-Destroy\"></span> Business Opportunities</span></h3>\n<p><b>Keyword</b>: destroy<br/>\n<b>Reward</b>: 1200 experience and 3 <a href=\"#/wiki/Platinum%20Coin\">Platinum Coins</a><br/>\n<b>Notes</b>: this is one of the harder tasks, involving exploration of the Corym caves.\n</p><p>Go to the <a href=\"#/wiki/Venore%20Corym%20Cave\">Corym Caves</a>, through a house north-east of Rafzan's building (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33072,32089,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33072, 32089, 7)</a>). Look for <span class=\"new\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvSnVua19UcnVuaz9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\" title=\"Junk Trunk (page does not exist)\">Junk Trunks</span> (they look like <a href=\"#/wiki/Large%20Trunk\">Large Trunks</a>) and use your <a href=\"#/wiki/Trunkhammer\">Trunkhammer</a> on 3 of them. They will turn into <span class=\"new\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvU21hc2hlZF9UcnVuaz9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\" title=\"Smashed Trunk (page does not exist)\">Smashed Trunks</span>. After completion, your <a href=\"#/wiki/Trunkhammer\">Trunkhammer</a> will disappear. When done, go back to <a href=\"#/wiki/Rafzan\">Rafzan</a> and report about your task.\n</p>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\" data-seq-no=\"0\" hash=\"2bdbeb1707bfbf725510e042d33fa4ec\" id=\"w-gallery-0\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:153px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Goblin_Merchant_Quest_Trunk-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:151px; width:185px;\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"151\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Goblin_Merchant_Quest_Trunk_945fea.png\" style=\"\" title=\"Goblin Merchant Quest Trunk.png (178 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div></div></div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Goblin_Advertisement\"><span id=\"w-Advertisement\"></span> Goblin Advertisement</span></h3>\n<p><b>Keyword</b>: advertisement<br/>\n<b>Reward</b>: 600 experience and 1 <a href=\"#/wiki/Platinum%20Coin\">Platinum Coin</a><br/>\n</p><p>All around the Venore swamp are <a href=\"#/wiki/Cracked%20Stone\">Cracked Stones</a>. Use your advertisement signs on the stones. You can only do this once per stone in a given time. Three nearby places you can find cracked stones are <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33054,32093,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33054, 32093, 7)</a>, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33033,32086,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33033, 32086, 7)</a> and <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33025,32090,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33025, 32090, 7)</a>. When done, go back to Rafzan and report about your task.\n</p>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\" data-seq-no=\"1\" hash=\"3dc7cf0fce2ff48e41b128db2d6808a5\" id=\"w-gallery-1\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:153px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Goblin_Merchant_Quest_Sign-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:151px; width:185px;\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"151\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Goblin_Merchant_Quest_Sign_cb375f.png\" style=\"\" title=\"Goblin Merchant Quest Sign.png (186 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div></div></div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Guardian_Angel_-_Kind_Of\"><span id=\"w-Guards\"></span> Guardian Angel - Kind Of</span></h3>\n<p><b>Keyword</b>: guards<br/>\n<b>Reward</b>: 600 experience and 1 <a href=\"#/wiki/Platinum%20Coin\">Platinum Coin</a><br/>\n</p><p>You will be given a <a href=\"#/wiki/Guardcatcher\">Guardcatcher</a> which looks like a <a href=\"#/wiki/Bow\">Bow</a>. All around the swamp you will find <a href=\"#/wiki/Adventurer\">Adventurers</a>. Use the guardcatcher on at least three adventurers. When you use the guardcatcher, one of two things can happen: the adventurer can vanish (saying \"<span class=\"sounds tibiatext tibiaorange\">Arrrgh! Not my knee!</span>\"), or the adventurer can become an <a href=\"#/wiki/Angry%20Adventurer\">Angry Adventurer</a> (saying \"<span class=\"sounds tibiatext tibiaorange\">You fiend! I will get you, servant of evil!</span>\"). When you've kneecapped three Adventurers, your guardcatcher will break (with the message \"<span class=\"tibiatext tibiawhite\">Luckily the makeshift bow breaks as you hit the last adventurer you needed and not earlier!</span>\"). Report back to Rafzan when you are done.\n</p>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\" data-seq-no=\"2\" hash=\"f0d4dde006392c63606c90bf95536f0f\" id=\"w-gallery-2\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:153px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Goblin_Merchant_Quest_Adventurer_Success-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:151px; width:185px;\"><img alt=\"Successfully hitting an adventurer\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"Successfully hitting an adventurer\" height=\"151\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Goblin_Merchant_Quest_Adventurer_Success_7af7e5.png\" style=\"\" title=\"Goblin Merchant Quest Adventurer Success.png (200 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Successfully hitting an adventurer</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:153px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Goblin_Merchant_Quest_Adventurer_Fail-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:151px; width:185px;\"><img alt=\"Adventurer becoming angry\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"Adventurer becoming \" height=\"151\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Goblin_Merchant_Quest_Adventurer_Fail_d590e0.png\" style=\"\" title=\"Goblin Merchant Quest Adventurer Fail.png (174 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Adventurer becoming <a href=\"#/wiki/Angry%20Adventurer\">angry</a></div></div></div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Hungry_Birds\"><span id=\"w-Kill\"></span> Hungry Birds</span></h3>\n<p><b>Keyword</b>: kill<br/>\n<b>Reward</b>: 600 experience and 1 <a href=\"#/wiki/Platinum%20Coin\">Platinum Coin</a><br/>\n</p><p>All around the swamp you will find <a href=\"#/wiki/Marsh%20Stalker\">Marsh Stalkers</a>. Kill 5 of them and report back to Rafzan.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Rattraction\"><span id=\"w-Perfume\"></span> Rattraction</span></h3>\n<p><b>Keyword</b>: perfume<br/>\n<b>Reward</b>: 1000 experience and 2 <a href=\"#/wiki/Platinum%20Coin\">Platinum Coins</a><br/>\n</p><p>You need to get some odor samples. You will receive a <a href=\"#/wiki/Perfume%20Gatherer%20%28First%29\">Perfume Gatherer</a> from <a href=\"#/wiki/Rafzan\">Rafzan</a> to collect the samples with.\n</p>\n<ul><li>The first odor you're looking for is special snail slime. Find the Venore <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32967,32144,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">Slug Cave (32967, 32144, 7)</a>, kill a slug, wait 10 seconds and use the perfume gatherer on it. A message will appear: <span class=\"tibiatext tibiawhite\">You gather the first part of the rat perfume!</span></li>\n<li>The second odor you're looking for is from <span class=\"new\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQmxhY2tfU3dhbXBfR2FzP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\" title=\"Black Swamp Gas (page does not exist)\">Black Swamp Gas</span>, which looks like smoke, or <a href=\"#/wiki/Poison%20Gas\">Poison Gas</a> colored grey. You can find these in a few places in the swamp, two such places are <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33096,32064,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33096, 32064, 7)</a> and <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33065,32120,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33065, 32120, 7)</a>. Use your perfume gatherer on it. A message will appear: <span class=\"tibiatext tibiawhite\">You gather the second part of the rat perfume!</span></li>\n<li>The third odor you're looking for is a <a href=\"#/wiki/Rotworm\">Rotworm</a> fart. Go to any cave with <a href=\"#/wiki/Rotworm\">Rotworms</a>, <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33028,32088,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">such as here (33028, 32088, 7)</a> Use the perfume gatherer on the rotworm repeatedly until you receive a rotworm fart. On failure, you will receive a message: <span class=\"tibiatext tibiawhite\">Darn! It didn't fart!</span>, and on success: <span class=\"tibiatext tibiawhite\">You gather the third part of the rat perfume!</span>. On average it will take about 3.85 attempts, but the rotworm does not vanish when you fail or succeed.</li>\n<li>The fourth and final odor you need is that of <a href=\"#/wiki/Mouldy%20Cheese\">Mouldy Cheese</a>. Get mouldy cheese from <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32934,32217,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">Venore Swamp Trolls (32934, 32217, 7)</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Goblin\">Goblins</a> (rare), <a href=\"#/wiki/Corym%20Caves\">Corym Caves</a> and many other places (daily respawns). The mouldy cheese can be obtained before the quest.</li></ul>\n<p>Report back to <a href=\"#/wiki/Rafzan\">Rafzan</a> with the complete <a href=\"#/wiki/Perfume%20Gatherer%20%28First%29\">Perfume Gatherer</a> (its description: <i>It is filled with smelley goo.</i>).\n</p>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\" data-seq-no=\"3\" hash=\"39bea523dd9e67dd09b88abf3d411d65\" id=\"w-gallery-3\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:153px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Goblin_Merchant_Quest_Slug_Cave-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:151px; width:185px;\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"151\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Goblin_Merchant_Quest_Slug_Cave_d34d06.png\" style=\"\" title=\"Goblin Merchant Quest Slug Cave.png (194 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:153px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Goblin_Merchant_Quest_Swamp_Gas-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:151px; width:185px;\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"151\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Goblin_Merchant_Quest_Swamp_Gas_6161a0.png\" style=\"\" title=\"Goblin Merchant Quest Swamp Gas.png (174 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:153px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Goblin_Merchant_Quest_Rotworm_Fart-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:151px; width:185px;\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"151\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Goblin_Merchant_Quest_Rotworm_Fart_b80494.png\" style=\"\" title=\"Goblin Merchant Quest Rotworm Fart.png (169 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:153px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-2020-06-13_114047540_Ric_Nexus_Hotkey-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:136px; width:185px; top:7.5px;\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"151\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/2020_06_13_114047540_Ric_Nexus_Hotkey_7d33a1.png\" style=\"\" title=\"2020-06-13 114047540 Ric Nexus Hotkey.png (341 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div></div></div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-To_Piss_Off_Some_Rats\"><span id=\"w-Busy\"></span> To Piss Off Some Rats</span></h3>\n<p><b>Keyword</b>: busy<br/>\n<b>Reward</b>: 1200 experience and 3 <a href=\"#/wiki/Platinum%20Coin\">Platinum Coins</a><br/>\n<b>Notes</b>: this is one of the harder tasks, involving exploration of the Corym caves.\n</p><p>Go north-east of his building to the <a href=\"#/wiki/Venore%20Corym%20Cave\">Venore Corym Cave</a>. Once in the cave, go east and down the hole, then go far east to a pond (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33137,32094,10\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33137, 32094, 10)</a>). <b>Use</b> the rat urine vial in the center of the pond (from a distance, like you would a fishing rod). A message will appear: <i>The keen noses of the ratmen will smell the mark of their rivals!</i>. Report back to <a href=\"#/wiki/Rafzan\">Rafzan</a> and claim your reward.\n</p>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\" data-seq-no=\"4\" hash=\"a7edb95674f49fb0f1260daab4b9a747\" id=\"w-gallery-4\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:153px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Goblin_Merchant_Quest_Rat_Urine-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:151px; width:185px;\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"151\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Goblin_Merchant_Quest_Rat_Urine_6e6ef5.png\" style=\"\" title=\"Goblin Merchant Quest Rat Urine.png (155 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Transcripts\">Transcripts</span></h2>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>hi</b><br/>\nRafzan: Hello, hello. Me peaceful, poor and honest goblin. Are you lookin' for {trade} or want to {help} me?<br/>\nPlayer: <b>tasks</b><br/>\nRafzan: Are you here to {get} a task or to {report} you finished task?<br/>\nPlayer: <b>get</b><br/>\nRafzan: So much to be done! Me desperately need {advertising}. Me have to create new ratmen {perfume}. Me in need of {guards} to keep me safe when trading. ...<br/>\nRafzan: Me looking for someone to keep ratmen {busy}, me need hero to {destroy} some ratmen stuff, and me need someone to {kill} evil marsh stalker.<br/>\nPlayer: <b>report</b><br/>\nRafzan: What are you reporting about? Me {advertising} campaign, the {perfume}, recruitment of {guards}, keeping the ratmen {busy}, that you {destroyed} certain provisions or {killing} the marsh stalkers?<br/>\nPlayer: <b>bye</b><br/>\nRafzan: Bye bye. Come back with much money to trade soon.\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Goblin Merchant Quest</strong></span>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Business_Opportunities_2\">Business Opportunities</span></h3>\n<dl><dt>Getting the mission.</dt></dl>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\nPlayer: <b>destroy</b><br/>\nRafzan: Ratmen often make deal with poor me. Sad story short, they always make profit, me never. If stuff they buy is destroyed, they have to buy new stuff. I need you to destroy stuff they bought from me.  ...<br/>\nRafzan: But ratmen are STRONG and DANGEROUS!!! (Not recommended for levels below 35) Better not go alone when you are inexperienced. Are you helping poor me?<br/>\nPlayer: <b>yes</b><br/>\nRafzan: Oh, so thankful me be! Take this hammer and use it on the crates they got from me. Me sure they not yet unpacked it, you find it in some storage area.<br/>\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Goblin Merchant Quest</strong></span>\n</p>\n<dl><dt>Reporting the mission.</dt></dl>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\nPlayer: <b>destroy</b><br/>\nRafzan: You did not too bad me guess. Though me children will starve, I give you biggest reward, don't tell others. Only you get good reward. You are me best.<br/>\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Goblin Merchant Quest</strong></span>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Goblin_Advertisement_2\">Goblin Advertisement</span></h3>\n<dl><dt>Getting the mission.</dt></dl>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\nPlayer: <b>advertising</b><br/>\nRafzan: Me need to get well known all over the swamp. Cheapest prices, best service in whole swamp. Me need you to place some advertisement signs in the swamp. Are you helping poor me?<br/>\nPlayer: <b>yes</b><br/>\nRafzan: Me need to get well known all over the swamp. Cheapest prices, best service in whole swamp. Me need you to place some advertisement signs in the swamp. Are you helping poor me?<br/>\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Goblin Merchant Quest</strong></span>\n</p>\n<dl><dt>Reporting the mission.</dt></dl>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\nPlayer: <b>advertising</b><br/>\nRafzan: You did not too bad me guess. Though me children will starve, I give you biggest reward, don't tell others. Only you get good reward. You are me best.<br/>\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Goblin Merchant Quest</strong></span>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Guardian_Angel_-_Kind_Of_2\">Guardian Angel - Kind Of</span></h3>\n<dl><dt>Getting the mission.</dt></dl>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\nPlayer: <b>guards</b><br/>\nRafzan: Me little, me weak. Me need strong guys to protect me. Sadly humans love more be adventurers than protecting poor goblin,. Me think they think adventuring is more fun and safe. ...<br/>\nRafzan: Me think when something bad would happen to them, that would teach them. Are you helping poor me?<br/>\nPlayer: <b>yes</b><br/>\nRafzan: Oh, so thankful me be! Take this bow and secretly shoot them with it. It's only little bow, won't do much harm. Some of them might reconsider becoming me guard.<br/>\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Goblin Merchant Quest</strong></span>\n</p>\n<dl><dt>Reporting the mission.</dt></dl>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\nPlayer: <b>guards</b><br/>\nRafzan: You did not too bad me guess. Though me children will starve, I give you biggest reward, don't tell others. Only you get good reward. You are me best.<br/>\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Goblin Merchant Quest</strong></span>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Hungry_Birds_2\">Hungry Birds</span></h3>\n<dl><dt>Getting the mission.</dt></dl>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\nPlayer: <b>kill</b><br/>\nRafzan: Mean marsh stalkers are threatening me little shop. They are the woodpeckers of swamp! Constantly hacking at me precious little building. Soon me be ruined. Are you helping poor me?<br/>\nPlayer: <b>yes</b><br/>\nRafzan: Oh, so thankful me be! You must kill five of this horrible goblin hut gnawers to teach them a lesson! CAN YOU HEAR ME MARSH STALKERS?! SWEET GOBLIN REVENGE IS ON ITS WAY!<br/>\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Goblin Merchant Quest</strong></span>\n</p>\n<dl><dt>Reporting the mission.</dt></dl>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\nPlayer: <b>kill</b><br/>\nRafzan: You did not too bad me guess. Though me children will starve, I give you biggest reward, don't tell others. Only you get good reward. You are me best.<br/>\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Goblin Merchant Quest</strong></span>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Rattraction_2\">Rattraction</span></h3>\n<dl><dt>Getting the mission.</dt></dl>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\nPlayer: <b>perfume</b><br/>\nRafzan: Me mostly deal with ratmen for old stuff they collected. Nothing to make any profit, nonono. But me need stuff to keep alive. Ratmen are fond of perfume I invented. ...<br/>\nRafzan: I need you to create more of it. Are you helping poor me?<br/>\nPlayer: <b>yes</b><br/>\nRafzan: Oh, so thankful me be! Use this container in the correct order on the following: ...<br/>\nRafzan: First, FRESH snail slime from a slain snail. Any snail you find will do. You will have to wait a little before its corpse will allow you to gather the slime. ...<br/>\nRafzan: Second, add a sample black swamp gas that can be found in some remote areas of the swamp. ...<br/>\nRafzan: Third, the fart of a rotworm. Rotworms eat the strangest things and their farts have a special ... odour. Use the container on a living rotworm. With some luck you catch a fart. ...<br/>\nRafzan: Last, you need to use the container on mouldy cheese, this is what ratmen love most! You might find some in possession of goblins. If you are done, return the container to me.<br/>\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Goblin Merchant Quest</strong></span>\n</p>\n<dl><dt>Reporting the mission.</dt></dl>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr cla